==German==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|goh|de}} ''scultera'', ''scultra'' originally *''skuldera'', from {{etyl|gem-pro|de}} {{m|gem-pro|*skuldrô||shoulder}}. Compare Low German {{m|nds|Schuller}}, Dutch {{m|nl|schouder}}, English {{m|en|shoulder}}, Danish {{m|da|skulder}}, Swedish {{m|sv|skuldra}}.

